visual reaction (the pad is an `Area3D`, so nothing is physically blocked either).\n\nThe tunables (`launch_force`, `rebound_time`, `squash_scale`) are `@export`ed for easy feel-tuning, and rest scale is captured at `_ready` so nothing else about the scene changes. I ran the project through the Godot MCP server — it launches with **no parse or runtime errors**.\n\nOne note: the three pads placed in `main.tscn` are rotated about the Y axis, so their surface normal is still straight up (they launch vertically); the outward-launch behavior kicks in for any pad actually resting on a tilted slope.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8944ab55-e53f-4d35-860d-5d7583d8e338","total_cost_usd":0.77444825,"usage":{"input_tokens":40,"cache_creation_input_tokens":31488,"cache_read_input_tokens":559791,"output_tokens":11092,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5233,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":26255},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":886,"cache_read_input_tokens":38397,"cache_creation_input_tokens":456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":456,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":544,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.000629,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-8":{"inputTokens":40,"outputTokens":11092,"cacheReadInputTokens":559791,"cacheCreationInputTokens":31488,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.77381925,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"1664a024-5ef1-4991-9dc3-46fed7faa715"}
